        "Abstract": "This paper introduces FQuAD, a native French Question Answering Dataset. FQuAD contains 25,000+ question and answer pairs. Finetuning CamemBERT on FQuAD yields a F1 score of 88% and an exact match of 77.9%. Developed to provide a SQuAD equivalent in the French language. Questions are original and based on high quality Wikipedia articles."
